sequenceDiagram
    participant BEAT as celery-beat
    participant W as celery-worker
    participant GLPI as API GLPI
    participant LS as Logstash
    participant ES as Elasticsearch

    loop Chaque heure (crontab minute=0)
        BEAT->>W: sync_glpi_to_elk
        W->>GLPI: GET /apirest.php/Ticket (état, statut, assignation)
        GLPI-->>W: tickets[]
        W->>W: normalisation + enrichissement
        W->>LS: POST documents glpi-*
        LS->>ES: indexation glpi-*
        Note over W,ES: Synchronise l'état des tickets pour les tableaux de bord
    end
